@KinemoPlatform_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5089

### OpenAPI document
GET {{KinemoPlatform_API_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### List movies
GET {{KinemoPlatform_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/movies
Accept: application/json

### Create a movie
POST {{KinemoPlatform_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "title": "Dune: Part Two",
  "durationMinutes": 166,
  "genre": "SciFi"
}